41:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166807498,"discussion_id":"7adffb40b92f682eb1c53332ed6abd26248737e6","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复FlashAttention梯度计算后处理模块中，在处理TND数据布局时，因批次索引`bIdx`超出有效范围而导致的数组越界访问风险。原逻辑在`bIdx >= b`时仍会访问`seqS`数组的非法内存地址，可能引发运行时错误或数据污染。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`NZVecClc`函数及其特化版本的循环中，增加了对批次索引`bIdx`的边界检查。修改后，仅在`bIdx < b`时通过`seqS[bIdx] - seqS[bIdx - 1]`计算当前序列长度`curS`；否则将`curS`安全地设置为0。此改动消除了越界访问，确保了内存操作的安全性。","created_at":"2026-03-30T10:41:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T10:41:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166808069,"discussion_id":"e7a24b892e3ef0c88ddb940e8668b760d908bb6b","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-30T10:44:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T10:44:35+08:00","user":{"id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","login":"hz36amy_00","object_id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","name":"yf_zhou","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/fe/f7239cf91485e812c31979edd3584327eaab4edbd7f232c495d1e234e28e9df3.png?time=1757139706596","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hz36amy_00"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166808259,"discussion_id":"1d80b84498eb5b5a77b813f2b9754e5c83e69e2d","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=694b8aa89c9247a9b0ebfb99d88b39d9&projectName=CANN'>694b8aa89c9247a9b0ebfb99d88b39d9</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastruct